; Menus

passivemenu=Standard Passive|0|false|Permanent one-time upgrades that boost your baking production across every future run.
headstartmenu=Standard Head Start|0|false|Permanent one-time upgrades that give you a resource boost at the start of each new run.
endlesspassivemenu=Endless Passive|10|false|Infinite production boosts with no limit, unlocked once you have cleared every standard prestige upgrade at prestige level 10.
endlessheadstartmenu=Endless Head Start|10|false|Infinite head start boosts with no limit, unlocked once you have cleared every standard prestige upgrade at prestige level 10.

; Item format: menu:id:base_cost:cost_multiplier:min_level:hidden:infinite:amount:description
; Standard items use cost_multiplier 1 and infinite false, so they stay one-time flat-cost buys.

; Standard items

; Prestige level 0

passivemenu:cookie_multiplier_1:5:1:0:false:false:1:A permanent 1% boost to all cookie production. Stacks with every purchase.
passivemenu:coin_multiplier_1:5:1:0:false:false:1:A permanent 1% boost to all money earned from selling cookies. Stacks with every purchase.
passivemenu:rank_discount_1:10:1:0:false:false:1:Reduces the cookies needed to rank up by 1%. Stacks with every purchase.
headstartmenu:starting_coins_1:5:1:0:false:false:50:Begin each run with 50 cents already in your pocket.
headstartmenu:starting_autocookie_1:5:1:0:false:false:1:Begin each run with 1 auto cookie already baked in.
headstartmenu:starting_manualcookie_1:10:1:0:false:false:1:Begin each run with 1 manual cookie ready to go.

